          "sourceUrl2": "https://www.worldhistory.org/article/850/the-fall-of-the-aztec-empire/",
          "sourceSnippet2": "World History Encyclopedia — The Fall of the Aztec Empire",
          "source3": "National Archives UK",
          "sourceUrl3": "https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/help-with-your-research/research-guides/spanish-colonial-history/",
          "sourceSnippet3": "National Archives UK — Spanish colonial history in the Americas"
